description:
CI phpmd job faalt (exit 2). Regressie na eerdere fix (bead mix7).

**Warnings:**
- Cyclomatic Complexity 11 (threshold 10) — was 10 na mix7 refactor
- NPath complexity 243 (threshold 200) — was 288 → 200 na mix7, nu weer 243

**Oorzaak:** bead **eiig** (font_size settings) heeft twee losse if-blokken toegevoegd voor body_font_size en heading_font_size die de map-loop bypassen:
  if ($body_size !== NULL && ...) { $styles[] = '--shindo-body-font-size:' . $body . '%'; }
  if ($heading_size !== NULL && ...) { $styles[] = ... }

Elk if-blok = 2 branches → CC + NPath vermenigvuldigen.

**Fix:** integreer beide settings in de bestaande $shindo_vars map. Ondersteun een 'suffix' element (bijv. '%') per entry:

  $shindo_vars = [
    'primary_color'        => ['--shindo-primary', '#252122', ''],
    'button_color'         => ['--shindo-button', '#252122', ''],
    ...
    'body_font_size'       => ['--shindo-body-font-size', '100', '%'],
    'heading_font_size'    => ['--shindo-heading-font-size', '100', '%'],
  ];

Update de foreach loop om suffix op te nemen:
  foreach ($shindo_vars as $key => [$var, $default, $suffix]) {
    $styles[] = $var . ':' . ($settings->getSetting($key) ?: $default) . $suffix;
  }

**Verify:** bin/phpmd op shindo.theme → 0 warnings; curl homepage → dezelfde CSS vars (--shindo-body-font-size:100%, --shindo-heading-font-size:100%).

Aanraken: web/themes/custom/shindo/shindo.theme (_shindo_html_build_style_declarations).

